		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Twisting, gold-scaled, wingless dragon. Supreme keepers of Balance.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17, <strong>HP</strong> 63, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 thunder breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Discordance</strong>. Lawful or chaotic creatures have DISADV on attacks and checks against dragon.</p><p></p><p><strong>Imperious</strong>. Lightning immune. Shapechange and assume the form of a humanoid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Reflective</strong>. 3:6 chance hostile spells are reflected back at their originator.</p><p></p><p><strong>Thunder Breath</strong>. A double near-size cube of pealing thunder extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 4d6 damage and deafened 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
